--- model delete path regression caught and fixed in-slice ---
The relationship first broke tests/test_search.py::test_fts_triggers_follow_asset_insert_update_delete
(stash-proved: FAILED on WORK_HEAD, PASSED on BASE): on `session.delete(asset)` the ORM
nulled `assertion.asset_id` (NOT NULL) instead of letting the FK cascade. Fixed by declaring
`cascade="all, delete-orphan"` on `Asset.assertions`, matching the schema's
`ondelete="CASCADE"`. Re-run:
$ backend/venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/test_search.py::test_fts_triggers_follow_asset_insert_update_delete -q
1 passed, 2 warnings in 0.81s
